Starter set. The existing repository vocabulary remains authoritative and must be merged before runtime use.

### Abbreviations
- IEP: Individualized Education Program
- IDEA: Individuals with Disabilities Education Act
- FAPE: free appropriate public education
- LRE: least restrictive environment
- PLAAFP: present levels of academic achievement and functional performance
- PLOP: present levels of performance
- SDI: specially designed instruction
- SLP: speech-language pathologist
- OT: occupational therapy
- PT: physical therapy
- ESY: extended school year
- IEE: independent educational evaluation
- PWN: prior written notice
- FBA: functional behavioral assessment
- BIP: behavior intervention plan
- WCPM: words correct per minute
- ORF: oral reading fluency
- SLD: specific learning disability
- OHI: other health impairment
- ED: emotional disturbance
- ASD: autism spectrum disorder
- SS: standard score
- PR: percentile rank
- GE: grade equivalent
- CBM: curriculum-based measurement

### Unit aliases
- min/week: minutes per week, min per week, mins/wk, min/wk, minutes weekly
- minutes: min, mins, minute sessions
- sessions/week: x/week, times per week, x weekly, times weekly
- WCPM: words correct per minute, wcpm
- %: percent, per cent

### Field synonyms
- service.service_type: specially designed instruction, SDI, resource, pull-out instruction
- service.service_type: speech-language therapy, speech therapy, speech services
- placement.setting: LRE, least restrictive environment, educational environment, placement
- present_level.statement: PLAAFP, PLOP, present levels
- measure.score_type: WCPM, words correct per minute, wcpm
- measure.score_type: % accuracy, percent accuracy, accuracy
